// The benchmark's enemy (M5 B3): the ward's Lancer (`tools/figures/lancer.figure.ron`) at spec §3.4's
// enemy row, 8,000 triangles, for cost, not beauty. The same skeleton, joint for joint (a test holds them
// equal), so the Lancer's clips play on it; the same shapes cut finer (two and a half times the sides,
// more on the body, hat and robe panels to land on the row exactly), unwrapped across maps the cast
// scales, in a crimson robe with amber glow. The cast writes it under its own folder, so `dir` is
// replaced (`bench/cast/cast.ron`).
(
    type: "sapphire::pipeline::Figure",
    version: 2,
    data: (
        dir: "cast/enemy",
        name: "enemy",
        max_triangles: 8000,
        triangles: Some(8000),
        maps: Some((size: 256, grain: 0.04)),
        joints: [
            (name: "root", at: (0.0, 0.0, 0.0), aim: Some((0.0, 1.0, 0.0))),
            (name: "hips", parent: Some("root"), at: (0.0, 0.8, 0.0)),
            (name: "spine", parent: Some("hips"), at: (0.0, 0.9, 0.0)),
            (name: "chest", parent: Some("spine"), at: (0.0, 1.05, 0.0)),
            (name: "head", parent: Some("chest"), at: (0.0, 1.27, 0.01), aim: Some((0.0, 1.45, 0.01))),
